# Monument to Endurance: Bot1 pays the Monument with Black Lotus, then activates Masked Meower (Discard a card, Sacrifice this creature: Draw a card) discarding an Island. That discard
# triggers the Monument once (CR 603.2) and Bot1 chooses "Create a Treasure token" as the ability goes on the stack: one Treasure and the Meower's own
# draw. Bot2's cleanup discard on turn 2 (it draws to eight every turn it does nothing) is not "you discard": no second Treasure, no life lost by Bot2.

